message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the
  metadata below. Citing software is important for reproducibility and
  proper attribution of scientific work (Smith et al., 2016).
type: software
title: >-
  IndianConstitution: High-Performance Algorithmic Infrastructure &
  Deterministic Corpus Engine for the Constitution of India
abstract: >-
  IndianConstitution is a high-performance, strictly-typed Python infrastructure
  providing programmatic access to the complete text of the Constitution of
  India (articles, schedules, Preamble, 106th Amendment Act 2023).
  It implements a zero-dependency inverted-index search engine with O(1)
  per-token lookup, NetworkX-backed graph analysis for cross-article
  reference modelling, CPU-bound semantic search execution, and native
  interoperability with the scientific Python stack. The public API is fully
  type-annotated with 100% mypy strict-mode compliance. Designed for legal NLP,
  RAG pipelines, civic AI, and constitutional informatics.
